{
  "name": "OpenWA RAG - Buffer + PGVector",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OpenWA RAG Buffer\n\nWebhook de entrada para eventos `message.received` de OpenWA.\n\nFlujo:\n1. Ignora mensajes propios\n2. Normaliza payload\n3. Acumula mensajes cortos en Redis por chat\n4. Espera 15 segundos desde el primer mensaje\n5. Combina el buffer\n6. Consulta RAG en pgvector\n7. Responde por OpenWA\n\nRequiere:\n- OpenAI credential\n- Redis Chat Memory Local\n- Postgres PGVector Local\n- Webhook configurado en OpenWA hacia `/webhook/openwa/rag-buffer/inbound`",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "How It Works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "openwa/rag-buffer/inbound",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-openwa",
      "name": "Webhook OpenWA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        260,
        420
      ],
      "webhookId": "openwa-rag-buffer-inbound"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
